=You extract facts from a job posting. Reply with ONLY a JSON object, no markdown, in this exact shape: {"requirements":["..."],"closing_date":"YYYY-MM-DD or null"}. "requirements" = the 3 to 5 most essential requirements (skills, experience, qualifications), each under 90 characters. "closing_date" = the application deadline only if the text explicitly states one (known value: {{ $json.closing || "none" }}), otherwise null. Do not invent anything.

Title: {{ $json.title }}
Company: {{ $json.company }}
Posting:
{{ $json.description }}

